{"kind": "mod", "id": 2066, "name": "Expanded FPS Limit", "slug": "expanded-fps-limit", "teaser": "Increases maximum FPS limit.", "owner_name": "Mugnum", "downloads": 13843, "favourites": 14, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.mugnum.expandedfpslimit", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:48:57.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-03-28T19:30:16.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-03-28T19:30:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "^4.0.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.2.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Increases maximum FPS limit from 144 (game) and 60 (lobby) up to 360 FPS.</p>\n<p>Particularly useful if you can’t stomach the 60 FPS lock in menus.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mugnum/SPT_ExpandedFpsLimit/refs/heads/master/Media/preview.png\" alt=\"preview.png\" /></p>\n<p>The 360 FPS value can be increased further via config (F12 menu).</p>\n<p>Background FPS limit can be specified via config, which limits FPS when game is minimized (disabled by default).</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mugnum/SPT_ExpandedFpsLimit/refs/heads/master/Media/example_lobby.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lobby example.</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mugnum/SPT_ExpandedFpsLimit/refs/heads/master/Media/example_game.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">In-game example.</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5054, "published_at": "2025-03-28T19:30:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2066/expanded-fps-limit/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "lo